{%- comment -%}
  Local override of al-folio's _includes/footer.liquid (al_folio_core gem).

  Replaces the personal "about" footer with the IDEAS funding footer:
  the DOE Office of Science ASCR acknowledgment (contract DE-AC02-06CH11357)
  and Argonne / DOE Office of Science logos. No contact email is published.

  Tracked with the al-folio overrides audit (ADR-0001):
  bundle exec al-folio upgrade overrides audit
{%- endcomment -%}

<footer class="sticky-bottom mt-5" role="contentinfo">
  <style>
    .ideas-footer-logo {
      height: 48px;
      width: auto;
    }
    html[data-theme='dark'] .ideas-footer-logo {
      /* The logos have black wordmarks; keep them legible on dark backgrounds
         by putting them on a white chip instead of inverting official colors. */
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
    }
  </style>
  <div class="container">
    <hr>
    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row align-items-center justify-content-center gap-3">
      <img
        src="{{ '/assets/img/logos/argonne.svg' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}"
        alt="Argonne National Laboratory logo"
        class="ideas-footer-logo"
        loading="lazy"
      >
      <img
        src="{{ '/assets/img/logos/doe-office-of-science.svg' | relative_url | bust_file_cache }}"
        alt="U.S. Department of Energy Office of Science logo"
        class="ideas-footer-logo"
        loading="lazy"
      >
    </div>
    <p class="text-center mt-2 mb-0">
      This material is based upon work supported by the U.S. Department of Energy, Office of Science, Office of Advanced Scientific Computing Research
      (ASCR) under Contract DE-AC02-06CH11357.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
